    "How would you react if I whispered in your ear that I want to f*ck your throat later — would that excite you or scare you?" : {
      "comment" : "Spicy · Deep",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wie würdest du reagieren, wenn ich dir ins Ohr flüstern würde, dass ich später deine Kehle ficken will – würde dich das erregen oder erschrecken?"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How would you react if I whispered in your ear that I want to f*ck your throat later — would that excite you or scare you?"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Cómo reaccionarías si te susurro al oído que quiero follarte la garganta más tarde? ¿Te excitaría o te asustaría?"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comment réagirais-tu si je chuchotais à ton oreille que je veux baiser ta gorge plus tard – est-ce que ça t'exciterait ou t'effraierait ?"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Come reagiresti se ti sussurrassi all'orecchio che voglio scoparti la gola più tardi – ti ecciterebbe o ti spaventerebbe?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "後でお前の喉を犯したいと耳元でささやいたら、どう反応する？興奮する？それとも怖がる？"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "나중에 네 목을 박고 싶다고 귀에 속삭이면 어떻게 반응할 거야? 흥분할 거야, 겁먹을 거야?"
